{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04262","headline":"晚泊江镇 · 骆宾王","name":"晚泊江镇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四运移阴律，三翼泛阳侯。\n荷香销晚夏，菊气入新秋。\n夜乌喧粉堞，宿雁下芦洲。\n海雾笼边徼，江风绕戍楼。\n转蓬惊别渚，徙橘怆离忧。\n魂飞灞陵岸，泪尽洞庭流。\n振影希鸿陆，逃名谢蚁丘。\n还嗟帝乡远，空望白云浮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}